editor_description = "First Surf (tide tutorial): one lane of tide floods across the path from the north shore on a short cycle, so the whole rhythm shows at once: red warning, wave push, retreat. Its first two retreats leave enemies on the wet sand; after that the tide runs empty until the next rest."

